<a href="https://www.nationaldahelpline.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Domestic Abuse Helpline (UK)</a>
</b>
<br>Free, confidential support. Call 0808 2000 247.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>
<a href="https://www.hotpeachpages.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hot Peach Pages</a>
</b>
<br>Global directory of domestic violence agencies.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>
<a href="https://www.iasp.info/suicidalthoughts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IASP</a>
</b>
<br>Find a local crisis line if you are in emotional distress.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>If you stay for now</b>
<br>Staying can be a safety choice, money, or hope. You are not failing by staying.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>If you set boundaries</b>
<br>Boundaries are your limits, not a way to control them.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>If you are considering leaving</b>
<br>Leaving can raise risk for a time. Plan when you can.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>Why Does He Do That? — Lundy Bancroft</b>
<br>A clear look at abusive thinking, often recommended by advocates.</div>
<div class="step">
<b>
<a href="https://outofthefog.website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Out of the FOG</a>
</b>
<br>Fear, obligation, and guilt in personality-disordered relationships.</div>
  </div>
</div>

